            </note>
            <note corresp="#d382-f2" n="2" xml:id="d382-f2-content">
                <p>On July 5 Ambassador Griffis urged that Admiral Sherman come to Madrid no later
                    than July 16. (Telegram 14, 752.5/7–551)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d382-f3" n="3" xml:id="d382-f3-content">
